class Scene_Battle < Scene_Base

  def create_info_viewport
    @info_viewport = Viewport.new
    @info_viewport.rect.y = 0 # this is the only line I changed
    @info_viewport.rect.height = @status_window.height
    @info_viewport.z = 100
    @info_viewport.ox = 64
    @status_window.viewport = @info_viewport
  end

end
Here you go. Just paste this into a new slot below materials, and above main.
I wouldn't recommend going to the core scripts and changing them directly(for compatibility with other scripts, and its a bit more annoying if you decide to change it back later.)
